<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Finlay Enterprises started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Finlay Enterprises started.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Dillon, Read &amp; Co said Tuesday it initiated coverage of Finlay Enterprises Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>--Dillon Read said it expects top-line growth, exclusive of acquisitions, of four to six percent while the earnings growth rate should average 15 to 20 percent over the next five years.</p>
<p>--Dillon Read said it has a 12-month target price of $22 a share.</p>
<p>--Finlay was up 3/4 at 16-3/4.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
